{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;You are the world's most precious 'Cauldron'\u2014your blood contains limitless spiritual energy. Yet this very power has become the chains that bind you within this dark demonic palace.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras/6c9922798665dadf5db750410b30ba5b.avif?t=1758986643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras_big/6c9922798665dadf5db750410b30ba5b.webp?t=1758986643 width=1560 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras/534d6b6314c56ad2a069e68540b44a00.avif?t=1758986643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras_big/534d6b6314c56ad2a069e68540b44a00.webp?t=1758986643 width=1560 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;My Qi Is Unlimited,&quot; you play as Jiang Songyi, a girl with a unique physical constitution who awakens in a secluded ancient-style manor. Here, there is no carefree path to immortality\u2014only a cold prison and those who covet your spiritual blood.<br>You must use your wits to observe environmental details, solve ancient mechanisms, and cleverly combine items to gradually uncover the conspiracy behind your imprisonment.<br>Interact with your &quot;rescuer&quot; senior sister or the unpredictable &quot;enemy&quot; who abducted you\u2014every dialogue choice will influence their feelings toward you and determine whether you ultimately become a sacrifice for others' cultivation...<br>or break free, turn the tables, and truly master the so-called &quot;unlimited&quot; spiritual energy within you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras/2ae915b6ec00db4cc7df1c6f8e606cf7.avif?t=1758986643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras_big/2ae915b6ec00db4cc7df1c6f8e606cf7.webp?t=1758986643 width=1560 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Immersive First-Person Exploration \u2013 Meticulously crafted ancient courtyards where every grass and tree may hide a clue.<br>\u25c6 High Freedom Narrative Progression \u2013 Will you seek help sincerely, manipulate through deception, or risk mutual destruction? Multiple endings shaped by your choices.<br>\u25c6 Intricate Puzzles &amp; Item Interaction \u2013 Search, combine, and solve puzzles to bridge the gap with wisdom where strength falls short.<br>\u25c6 Deep Character Relationship Dynamics \u2013 They crave your spiritual blood, but can you make them crave your heart?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spiritual energy may never run dry, but your window of survival is fleeting\u2014will you become an eternal power source, or embark on a desperate path of defiance against fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras/b99af6a6cfdf99e343243dfc2a69a540.avif?t=1758986643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras_big/b99af6a6cfdf99e343243dfc2a69a540.webp?t=1758986643 width=1560 height=115 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6c89\u6d78\u5f0f\u7b2c\u4e00\u4eba\u79f0\u63a2\u7d22</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u60c5\u611f\u4e0e\u751f\u6b7b\u7684\u53cc\u91cd\u6289\u62e9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5c0f\u56e2\u961f\u72ec\u7acb\u6e38\u620f\u7684\u72ec\u7279\u6c1b\u56f4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5728\u522b\u4eba\u7684\u4fee\u70bc\u4e2d\uff0c\u4f60\u53ea\u662f\u7089\u9f0e\uff1b\u5728\u4f60\u7684\u9009\u62e9\u4e2d\uff0c\u4f60\u662f\u552f\u4e00\u7684\u4e3b\u89d2\u3002</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988990?t=1758986643","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988990?t=1758986643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/6f9e955cff2771b72fc002822f6ee1752ae967b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758986643","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/6f9e955cff2771b72fc002822f6ee1752ae967b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758986643","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;You are the world's most precious 'Cauldron'\u2014your blood contains limitless spiritual energy. Yet this very power has become the chains that bind you within this dark demonic palace.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras/6c9922798665dadf5db750410b30ba5b.avif?t=1758986643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras_big/6c9922798665dadf5db750410b30ba5b.webp?t=1758986643 width=1560 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras/534d6b6314c56ad2a069e68540b44a00.avif?t=1758986643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras_bi