ve your heart?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spiritual energy may never run dry, but your window of survival is fleeting\u2014will you become an eternal power source, or embark on a desperate path of defiance against fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras/b99af6a6cfdf99e343243dfc2a69a540.avif?t=1758986643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/extras_big/b99af6a6cfdf99e343243dfc2a69a540.webp?t=1758986643 width=1560 height=115 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6c89\u6d78\u5f0f\u7b2c\u4e00\u4eba\u79f0\u63a2\u7d22</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u60c5\u611f\u4e0e\u751f\u6b7b\u7684\u53cc\u91cd\u6289\u62e9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5c0f\u56e2\u961f\u72ec\u7acb\u6e38\u620f\u7684\u72ec\u7279\u6c1b\u56f4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5728\u522b\u4eba\u7684\u4fee\u70bc\u4e2d\uff0c\u4f60\u53ea\u662f\u7089\u9f0e\uff1b\u5728\u4f60\u7684\u9009\u62e9\u4e2d\uff0c\u4f60\u662f\u552f\u4e00\u7684\u4e3b\u89d2\u3002</p></li></ul>","developers":["\u8001\u9f20\u5446\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988990/c9c09a51cb63e50acf4667b404a89d910dc37ea5/header.jpg?t=1758986643","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u6211\u7684\u7075\u6c14\u5438\u4e0d\u5b8c","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 @ 2,80 GHz, AMD FX 8120 @ 3.1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Me